Peek / Plico is an independent Rust implementation of the Git browsing UI in
hyoban/peek (https://github.com/hyoban/peek), licensed under the MIT License.
The initial reference checkout is aa19f58c5146e5f5da1047a1c9a2c1fe92309c53.
The three-column composition, labels and interaction conventions were adapted
from that project. Its MIT license is preserved in LICENSE. Go sources are not
vendored into this repository and are not build dependencies.

Lucide SVGs are generated into src/icons.rs; source revision and ISC license
are preserved in src/icons.rs.json and src/icons.rs.LICENSE.

Plico is separately licensed under Apache-2.0. It is used through pinned Git
dependencies; its source and licenses are provided by that dependency.
